    <section class="references" id="sect-00015">
    <title>References</title>
    <para id="para-00033">Abney, D. H., DaSilva, E. B., &amp; Bertenthal, B. I. (2021). Associations between infant-mother physiological synchrony and 4- and 6-month-old infants’ emotion regulation. <emphasis effect="italics">Developmental Psychobiology, 63</emphasis>(6), e22161. https://doi.org/10.1002/dev.22161</para>
